Run via `figma_execute` (replace `__FRAME_ID__`, `__COMPONENT_NAME__`, `__BRIEF_DESCRIPTION__`). Replace `__BRIEF_DESCRIPTION__` with the `briefDescription` composed during Step 4 sub-step 4c:

